{"id":"dfa5042443233c40","group":"58","path":"58/batch11/58-df-adjoint-functors.md","title":"Adjoint Functors","display":"df-adjoint-functors — Adjoint Functors","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-adjoint-functors","aliases":["58-df-adjoint-functors"],"display":"df-adjoint-functors — Adjoint Functors","depends_on":["[[../batch04/58-df-category.md]]","[[../batch18/58-df-functor.md]]","[[../batch09/58-df-natural-transformation.md]]","[[../batch04/58-df-category-data.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-adjoint-functors"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-adjoint-functors</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-adjoint-functors — Adjoint Functors"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a87b7e1119b63b2c\" href=\"?note=a87b7e1119b63b2c\" title=\"../batch04/58-df-category.md\">../batch04/58-df-category.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"877f1061e295cf5f\" href=\"?note=877f1061e295cf5f\" title=\"../batch18/58-df-functor.md\">../batch18/58-df-functor.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"970e2b8779070da0\" href=\"?note=970e2b8779070da0\" title=\"../batch09/58-df-natural-transformation.md\">../batch09/58-df-natural-transformation.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"e637becf421e4e61\" href=\"?note=e637becf421e4e61\" title=\"../batch04/58-df-category-data.md\">../batch04/58-df-category-data.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal C,\\mathcal D\">\\(\\mathcal C,\\mathcal D\\)</span> (categories)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"F:\\mathcal C\\to\\mathcal D\">\\(F:\\mathcal C\\to\\mathcal D\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G:\\mathcal D\\to\\mathcal C\">\\(G:\\mathcal D\\to\\mathcal C\\)</span> (functors)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\eta:1_{\\mathcal C}\\Rightarrow G\\circ F\">\\(\\eta:1_{\\mathcal C}\\Rightarrow G\\circ F\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varepsilon:F\\circ G\\Rightarrow1_{\\mathcal D}\">\\(\\varepsilon:F\\circ G\\Rightarrow1_{\\mathcal D}\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{id}_Z\">\\(\\mathrm{id}_Z\\)</span> (identity morphism of an object <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Z\">\\(Z\\)</span>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Category}_S,\\mathrm{Functor}_S,\\mathrm{NaturalTransformation}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Category}_S,\\mathrm{Functor}_S,\\mathrm{NaturalTransformation}_S\\)</span> (predicates from dependencies)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Adjoint}_S\\subseteq V^4\">\\(\\mathrm{Adjoint}_S\\subseteq V^4\\)</span> (adjunction predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}adjoint-functors} \\vdash \\mathrm{Adjoint}_S(F,G,\\mathcal C,\\mathcal D)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{Category}_S(\\mathcal C)\\land\\mathrm{Category}_S(\\mathcal D)\\land\\mathrm{Functor}_S(F,\\mathcal C,\\mathcal D)\\land\\mathrm{Functor}_S(G,\\mathcal D,\\mathcal C)\\land\\exists\\eta,\\varepsilon\\;\\Bigl(\\mathrm{NaturalTransformation}_S(\\eta,1_{\\mathcal C},G\\circ F,\\mathcal C,\\mathcal C)\\land\\mathrm{NaturalTransformation}_S(\\varepsilon,F\\circ G,1_{\\mathcal D},\\mathcal D,\\mathcal D)\\land\\forall X\\in\\operatorname{Obj}(\\mathcal C)\\;\\bigl(\\varepsilon_{F(X)}\\circ F(\\eta_X)=\\mathrm{id}_{F(X)}\\bigr)\\land\\forall Y\\in\\operatorname{Obj}(\\mathcal D)\\;\\bigl(G(\\varepsilon_Y)\\circ\\eta_{G(Y)}=\\mathrm{id}_{G(Y)}\\bigr)\\Bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}adjoint-functors} \\vdash \\mathrm{Adjoint}_S(F,G,\\mathcal C,\\mathcal D)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{Category}_S(\\mathcal C)\\land\\mathrm{Category}_S(\\mathcal D)\\land\\mathrm{Functor}_S(F,\\mathcal C,\\mathcal D)\\land\\mathrm{Functor}_S(G,\\mathcal D,\\mathcal C)\\land\\exists\\eta,\\varepsilon\\;\\Bigl(\\mathrm{NaturalTransformation}_S(\\eta,1_{\\mathcal C},G\\circ F,\\mathcal C,\\mathcal C)\\land\\mathrm{NaturalTransformation}_S(\\varepsilon,F\\circ G,1_{\\mathcal D},\\mathcal D,\\mathcal D)\\land\\forall X\\in\\operatorname{Obj}(\\mathcal C)\\;\\bigl(\\varepsilon_{F(X)}\\circ F(\\eta_X)=\\mathrm{id}_{F(X)}\\bigr)\\land\\forall Y\\in\\operatorname{Obj}(\\mathcal D)\\;\\bigl(G(\\varepsilon_Y)\\circ\\eta_{G(Y)}=\\mathrm{id}_{G(Y)}\\bigr)\\Bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Unit, counit and both triangle identities are explicit. This removes the former circular dependency on <code>58-df-unit-counit</code>, whose own definition depends on this atom.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch04/58-df-category.md","status":"resolved","id":"a87b7e1119b63b2c","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch04/58-df-category.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch18/58-df-functor.md","status":"resolved","id":"877f1061e295cf5f","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch18/58-df-functor.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch09/58-df-natural-transformation.md","status":"resolved","id":"970e2b8779070da0","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch09/58-df-natural-transformation.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch04/58-df-category-data.md","status":"resolved","id":"e637becf421e4e61","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch04/58-df-category-data.md]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathcal C,\\mathcal D","display":false},{"tex":"F:\\mathcal C\\to\\mathcal D","display":false},{"tex":"G:\\mathcal D\\to\\mathcal C","display":false},{"tex":"\\eta:1_{\\mathcal C}\\Rightarrow G\\circ F","display":false},{"tex":"\\varepsilon:F\\circ G\\Rightarrow1_{\\mathcal D}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{id}_Z","display":false},{"tex":"Z","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Category}_S,\\mathrm{Functor}_S,\\mathrm{NaturalTransformation}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Adjoint}_S\\subseteq V^4","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}adjoint-functors} \\vdash \\mathrm{Adjoint}_S(F,G,\\mathcal C,\\mathcal D)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{Category}_S(\\mathcal C)\\land\\mathrm{Category}_S(\\mathcal D)\\land\\mathrm{Functor}_S(F,\\mathcal C,\\mathcal D)\\land\\mathrm{Functor}_S(G,\\mathcal D,\\mathcal C)\\land\\exists\\eta,\\varepsilon\\;\\Bigl(\\mathrm{NaturalTransformation}_S(\\eta,1_{\\mathcal C},G\\circ F,\\mathcal C,\\mathcal C)\\land\\mathrm{NaturalTransformation}_S(\\varepsilon,F\\circ G,1_{\\mathcal D},\\mathcal D,\\mathcal D)\\land\\forall X\\in\\operatorname{Obj}(\\mathcal C)\\;\\bigl(\\varepsilon_{F(X)}\\circ F(\\eta_X)=\\mathrm{id}_{F(X)}\\bigr)\\land\\forall Y\\in\\operatorname{Obj}(\\mathcal D)\\;\\bigl(G(\\varepsilon_Y)\\circ\\eta_{G(Y)}=\\mathrm{id}_{G(Y)}\\bigr)\\Bigr)","display":true}],"bytes":1785,"backlinks":[{"id":"08f4a3081239a349","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Adjoint}_S:V^4\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}$ and $\\mathrm{Adjoint}_S(F,G,\\mathcal C,\\mathcal D)$ (see [[../batch11/58-df-adjoint-functors.md]])"},{"id":"f0b0fd432c3af58f","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"5902e6e